OL,3,ABad Girls star Helen Fraser dies aged  
OL,4,A84                                     
OL,6,FFrom 2004 until 2019, she was also an  
OL,7,Fambassador for East Anglia's Children's
OL,8,FHospices (EACH). The charity said it   
OL,9,Fwas "deeply saddened" by her death and 
OL,10,Fwould "remember her with enormous      
OL,11,Ffondness and gratitude".               
